---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="找不到页面">
  <section class="site-shell page-hero">
    <span class="eyebrow">404 / Lost in the garden</span>
    <h1>这块地方<br /><em>还没有长出来。</em></h1>
    <p>你访问的页面可能被移动了，或者它还只是一个写在草稿纸上的想法。</p>
    <div class="button-row" style="margin-top: 28px;"><a class="button button-primary" href="/">回到首页 ↗</a></div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
